                                                "sense_id": "44b86475-a156-35da-8cfa-c1a38a1101fb",
                                                "text": "This gives the future light cone of the event. Similarly, you can define the past light cone—as the history of a spherical shell of light converging in on the event. All these spatial spheres, past and future, represent cross-sections through the space–time light cone, […]"
                                            }
